NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE. This repository is a research and engineering exercise.
Nothing in it is a recommendation to buy or sell any security. It contains no
live trading capability and connects to no broker. Its central finding is that
the strategy studied does not beat a passive benchmark after costs.
